        <ul>
<li><strong>Jour 1</strong><span> Arrivée à Katmandou (1300m) Transfert à l’hôtel</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour2</strong><span> Journée libre à Katmandou</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 3</strong><span> Vol Katmandou – Tumlingtar</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 4</strong><span> Tumlingtar – Chyawabesi</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 5</strong><span>Chyawabesi – Kothe</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 6</strong><span>Kothe – Salpa Phedi (1680m).</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 7</strong><span>Salpa Phedi – Sanam par Guranse (2880m).</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 8</strong><span>Sanam par Guranse – Bung. (1900m)</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 9:</strong><span>Bung – Gai kharka (2300m).</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 10:</strong><span>Gai kharka – Pinyan (2830m).</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 11</strong><span> Pinyan – Phakding (2830m).</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 12</strong><span>Phakding – Namche Bazaar (3444m)</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 13</strong><span> Repos et acclimatation à Namche Bazaar.</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 14</strong><span> Namche Bazaar – Monastère de Tengboche (3875m)</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 15</strong><span> Monastère de Tengboche – Pheriche (4240 m)</span></li>
<li><strong>Day 16</strong><span> Repos et acclimatation à Pheriche</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 17</strong><span> Pheriche – Lobuje (4930m)</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 18</strong><span> Lobuje – Kala Pattar (5540m) – Lobuje (4930m)</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 19</strong><span> Lobuje – Monastère de Tengboche (3875m)</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 20</strong><span>  Monastère de Tengboche – Khumjung (3779m)</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 21</strong><span>Khumjung – Monjo (2800m)</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 22</strong><span> Monjo – Lukla (2800m)</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 23</strong><span>Lukla – Kathmandu par avion</span></li>
<li><strong>Jour 24</strong><span>Journée libre à Katmandou</span></li>
